From 8e8f4babd93853355c9aa338414ca17beda562d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evolve Expansion <expansion@example.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:11:47 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Silverblood v1.2 part 1: Awakening rework, Seats, records,
 veterans

Awakening rework
- Remove the global soldier meter. Only named warriors can Awaken, each
  at a hidden breaking point (70-130) with escalating warnings
- Rising floor: rest can't calm her below a share of her limit that
  grows with level and defied deaths (max 60%)
- Full Power toggle (bonuses x2, meter x3)
- Black Card at the brink: honour, save (Tonic or rest, with risk), ignore
- Handlers are assigned to individual warriors (-40% meter gain);
  Organizations give a small global calm
- New buildings: Silent Hall (upkeep, faster rest, lower floor cap) and
  Apothecary (brews Stillwater Tonic)
- Wild Awakened Ones with generated names, scaling with era, fame and
  Monster-infested planets
- Unbroken: first space mission with 3+ warriors, none ever Awakened
- Old saves: global meter dropped, legacy Awakened Ones stay huntable

Seats: 8 one-time "Commission a Seat" purchases gated by milestones.
Service record and chronicle per warrior, kept in the Hall.
Retire with severance, dismiss, parting mood, veterans who return,
and Awakening in exile.

Wiki Warriors page, structures notes, changelog, README, MODDING and
TESTING updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016HmsZPiTBCQAJJigd9ht6e
